  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A long\u2026 long time ago, before time itself, The Lone God separated
    the heavens from the earth with nothing but their bare hands. But when faced
    with the emptiness of space, THEY severed one of THEIR arms, casting it down
    to the void below. From this arm grew the mighty Supreme Tree of Life\u2014Yggdrasil.\n\nFrom
    the blood of the Lone God, Yggdrasil birthed the cycles of the world, and from
    their breath came the acorns. And so, the squirrels were born, tasked with guarding
    the tree and its bounty. But deep beneath Yggdrasil, an ancient force stirred.
    The Draughi, dark beings born of the tree\u2019s shadows, rose against the first
    inhabitants of the world.\n\nThus, a great war raged between the squirrels and
    the Draughi, and the fate of Yggdrasil was sealed. To punish the Draughi\u2019s
    defiance of the natural order, the Lone God transformed them into snakes\u2014forever
    bound to the roots of the tree, a symbol of their rebellion.\n\nAs the Lone God
    ascended to the heavens, THEY decreed that Yggdrasil would one day face Ragnarok.
    To survive the coming calamity, the squirrels must gather every acorn from Yggdrasil
    and deposit it into the tree, to prepare for Fimbulvinter\u2014the coldest winter
    the world has ever known.\n\nAnd so, the squirrels chose one among their kind,
    the bravest and most cunning of them all\u2014Ratatoskr. It is you, the Ratatoskr,
    who must embark on this perilous journey to save your world, collect the sacred
    acorns, and face the serpentine wrath of the Draughi\u2026 before time runs out."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
